msg-audio-remote_page_refused = The overlay page refused the clip.
msg-audio-remote_clip_not_offered = The server did not take the clip.
msg-audio-remote_not_delivered = The clip did not reach the overlay.
msg-audio-remote_not_pending = The clip is no longer waiting on a verdict.
msg-audio-remote_never_fetched = The overlay page never asked for the clip.
msg-audio-remote_no_verdict = The overlay page never reported whether it played the clip.
msg-audio-remote_withdrawn = The clip was withdrawn before it settled.
msg-audio-remote_server_stopped = The server stopped before the clip settled.
